=base:summary.cmark

An in-browser playground for [templating-lang](https://github.com/lucasdicioccio/templating-lang),
the expression/document language behind [`.templating` and `.templating-doc`
sections](/sections-templating.html), hosted directly on this site.

=base:main-content.cmark

This is the same playground built from the
[templating-lang](https://github.com/lucasdicioccio/templating-lang)
repository's PureScript sources, published here as a static bundle so it can
be tried without a local build. It parses and evaluates templating-lang
expressions and documents in the browser — nothing is sent to a server.

See [Templating-lang sections](/sections-templating.html) for how the same
language is embedded server-side, as a section pre-processor, by KitchenSink
itself.

<iframe class="playground-frame" src="/templating-playground.html" title="templating-lang playground"></iframe>

If the embedded frame does not load, open the
[playground](/templating-playground.html) directly.
